WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:03.350
of one city and one man.

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:06.310
Buffalo had been accepted in big sporting circles,

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:09.000
and for Jim Brule, owner of the Buffalo Bills,

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.720
this acceptance climaxed a long, vigorous fight

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.390
for the athletic recognition of his community.

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:16.130
The fans' keen interest in the Bills

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:18.810
made history in the 1947 season

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.530
by accounting for the last record at home

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.090
and across the country,

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:25.220
was the result of long hours of continuous training,

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:28.030
practice, quarterback meetings, chalk talks,

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.000
and preliminary workouts at the preseason

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:41.920
conditioning site in Hamilton, Ontario. Head coach Red Dawson, First Lieutenant Clem Crow,

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:47.180
and assistants Red Conkright, Chuck Jaskwitch, and John Scafidi plan new plays and drill the

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:51.740
builds assiduously to offset the effects of constant scouting by rival organizations.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:56.030
Professional football is a grim enterprise involving plenty of hard work.

00:00:56.030 --> 00:01:00.000
The team must be in top-flight condition to meet and cope with

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:06.850
rigors of a 14-game season. National and international interest in the Bills was reflected in the

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:11.750
many notables who attended the games. Pre-game ceremonies were dedicated to the celebration

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:17.680
of days of local, national, and global importance. Helping to commemorate these occasions were

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:30.000
Admiral Jonas Ingram, Commissioner of the All-America Conference at the Yankee game, Admiral Osborne

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.180
Wal Kolkwa, judge advocate of the United States Navy, who officiated at the Navy

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:38.540
Day exercises. Canada's Dominion Day was commemorated by Brigadier Dennis

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:49.200
Whittaker and the Highlanders from Hamilton. A tribute was paid to General

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:58.920
Pilsudski by presentation of a Polish national dance. And always between the

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:00.000
halves, the crack button

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:06.110
Buffalo Bills band and majorettes provided us with scintillating entertainment, but hold

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:07.110
on a minute.

00:02:07.110 --> 00:02:10.980
This is about football, and I want you to meet the man who enjoys the sport fully as

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:16.900
much as all of you, James F. Bruhl, president of the Frontier Oil Refining Corporation and

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.440
owner of the Buffalo Bills.

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:23.630
Hello, football fans.

00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:30.000
It is with great pleasure we bring you the condensed highlights of the Buffalo Bills 1947

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:37.000
which has proved to the sports world that Buffalo and Western New York deserve a Major League sport.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:45.930
At this time, I want to thank all you loyal fans, Red Dawson, his staff, and the entire football squad

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:54.760
for making the past season a great success. Take it away, Jim Wells. Not everyone so inclined was

00:02:54.760 --> 00:03:00.000
privileged to see the Bills in action during their successful season. Shut-ins, including hospital and

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.710
convalescent patients had to follow the fortunes of the club through splendid

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:07.700
newspaper accounts and play-by-play broadcasts. Here's a view of your

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:11.580
narrator at work offering word pictures of the Bills achievements via the

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:17.620
Buffalo Evening News frequency modulation station WBEN-FM. But now on

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:21.580
with a pictorial review of the past season. Much that you'll see brought

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:26.230
spontaneous cheers from the Bills avid supporters. Some wrung only groans of

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:30.000
despair, but all combined to make 1947 the banner

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:35.450
football year in Buffalo history. The season opened on the highest possible

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.450
note when a brilliant victory was achieved at the expense of the New York

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:42.680
Yankees, defending champions of the Eastern Division. But there were some

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:46.730
anxious moments including these at the outset. On the first place from scrimmage,

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:50.750
the Yankees' great Speck Sanders fakes off to Eddie Prokop, then throws a pass to

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:54.790
that Worthy in the left flat. Prokop dangles 49 yards to the Bills' 22

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.660
